'''Snowstorm''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was obtained from purchasing it from the [[Snowstorm Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]]. it is now only obtainable through trading as the gamepass has gone offsale

== Appearance ==
Its shape is very similar to that of [[Xenoknife]]. The entire knife is primarily a snowy white, except for a few light blue icy spikes protruding from the guard and pommel.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly gun [[Blizzard (Gun)|Blizzard]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Blizzard Set|Blizzard Set]].
* It has a chroma counterpart under the name [[Chroma Snowstorm]].
* This is the first godly knife from an item pack to not have a gamepass to buy it separately from the bundle.

